(no_connect
(at 232.41 72.39)
(uuid "f5d19a06-2522-5566-a0fd-7459e2e3e855")
)
(text "185 V RAIL, regulated this time. D9's 31 kHz clock reaches the MOSFET through a proper 12 V driver; a comparator\nwatches the rail through a 1.5 M / 20.5 k divider and holds the driver input low whenever FB is above VREF, so the\nstage skips cycles until the rail sags back. The trimmer is a rheostat in the divider's foot: 152 to 252 V. The\ninherited stage had none of this - it was an energy-limited 1 W source with a bleed trimmer (netlist sheet §2)."
(exclude_from_sim no)
(at 20.32 96.52 0)
(effects
